# route: level=w9_l2b_coop difficulty=expert players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=wipes:0,min_checkpoints:1,painting:15,unlocked:true,max_hurts:6,fight_ticks:1093..2185
# The two-stream Expert route of Storm Nest in co-op (designer D9a; recorded from closed-loop macros,
# build/d9a/bot_w9_l2b_coop.gd, P1|P2): the painting hollow (P1), the drop into the arena; the co-op Storm Roc:
# perched, P2 stands under its outer wing (the shield turns to him) while P1 high-strikes the head from the nest;
# both dodge its dives and strike the buried beak; in the storm P1 glides onto its back and P2 strikes the
# tumbling Roc's tail from the nest (Pilot and Spotter), three times; the fire-starter, the exit totem.
# Re-recorded in wf10 (bosses) with the same bot after the boss balance: the co-op gust drops a feather every 33 ticks
# (Roc.COOP_FEATHER_SLOWDOWN 3; the 7 hurts of the old route, four of them feathers, were one over the Expert cap of 6).
